  "html": "<div id=\"BUV\" class=\"uplift front\">\n    <section id=\"course-front-body\" class=\"responsive-padding\" style=\"color: #2d3b45; background: none; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px;\">\n        <article id=\"course-lesson-intro-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\n            <h3 class=\"heavy\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 2.7em;\">Dissertation 1</h3>\n            <p>Welcome to the final year of your degree! During this year, you will be required to complete a \u2018final project\u2019 or \u2018dissertation\u2019. This should be an interesting yet challenging journey for you as this module enables you to choose an award-related project that is best suited to your current areas of interest and career aspirations in hospitality.</p>\n        </article>\n        <div class=\"grid-row\">\n            <article class=\"col-lg-4 buv-responsive-video-100\" style=\"padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\"><iframe class=\"lti-embed\" style=\"display: inline-block; border: medium none currentcolor;\" title=\"Maren - Dissertation - Export 2\" src=\"https://buv.instructure.com/courses/7270/external_tools/retrieve?display=borderless&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbuv.instructuremedia.com%2Flti%2Flaunch%3Fcustom_arc_launch_type%3Dlearn_embed%26custom_arc_media_id%3D376ace0d-c10c-4ad4-bf8f-ba69755d311e-34658%26custom_arc_start_at%3D0\" width=\"850\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" webkitallowfullscreen=\"webkitallowfullscreen\" mozallowfullscreen=\"mozallowfullscreen\" allow=\"geolocation *; microphone *; camera *; midi *; encrypted-media *; autoplay *; clipboard-write *; display-capture *; fullscreen *\" data-studio-resizable=\"true\" data-studio-tray-enabled=\"true\" data-studio-convertible-to-link=\"true\"></iframe></article>\n            <article class=\"col-lg-8\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-left: 12px;\">\n                <h3><strong>Learning Objectives for this module:</strong></h3>\n                <p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Critically assess various research methodologies and data analysis techniques, understanding their application and limitations</p>\n                <p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Develop comprehensive research proposals, choosing appropriate research questions and conducting literature reviews.</p>\n                <p><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-size: 14pt;\">+ &nbsp;</span>Critically synthesize knowledge from previous modules, applying it to identify and explore relevant research areas within the hospitality and tourism industry</p>\n            </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-row responsive-padding\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; margin-bottom: -50px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"padding-left: 12px;\"><strong>Module Content:</strong></h3>\n</div>"
